      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "auditory"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The sabosan emits a deafening cry in a 30ft Type:cone. Non-sabosan creatures in this area must each succeed at a DC 22 Fortitude Saving Throw save or be Deafened for 1 minute.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Powerful Charge",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The sabosan Strides or Flies up to double their Speed and then makes a claw Strike. If the sabosan moved at least 20 feet, they deal an additional 1d6 slashing damage on a hit.</p>",
